; SniperTurtle_KZ_v1.00  -  FundedNext Stellar 1-Step $25K
; ATTACH TO XAUUSD  M15  -  NOT M5, NOT M3.
;
; ================= WHY THIS ONE =================
; Four years on M15, funded guards on, 0.5% risk. Firm limits are
; daily -750, max -1500 static, target +2500.
;
;         peak    trough   worst day   outcome
;   2023  + 721    -1192     -258      survived, no target
;   2024  + 890    -1132     -281      survived, no target
;   2025  +3194     -110     -276      PASSED
;   2026  +5123     -235     -257      PASSED
;
; It NEVER lost the account in four years - no daily breach, no max-loss
; breach - and passed in two. 2025 and 2026 are the years the config was
; selected on, so treat those two as flattered; 2023 and 2024 are honest,
; and in both it simply stalled rather than blowing up.
;
; That shape is what makes it usable HERE specifically: this plan has a
; minimum of 2 trading days and NO maximum. A config that never breaches and
; reaches target only in good years costs you time, not the account. A faster
; config that breaches in a bad year costs you the fee.
;
; 0.35% risk was also tested and passed only ONE year of four - lower risk
; does not buy safety here, it just slows you below the target. Both risk
; levels survived all four years; only 0.5% reached +2500 more than once.
;
; ================= WHAT IT IS =================
;   EMA 50/100/200, and the TRAIL OFF. Neither works without the other:
;   50/100 with the trail on made -323 across 2025, with it off +4889. The
;   slow signal produces a payoff near 22, so winners must be allowed to run.
;   Quality filter ON with VWAP as the only condition.
;   Killzone window on, 60-minute lead. No server session filter.
;   Guards: daily -600 (flatten), 3 losing trades, static DD, halt at -1200.
;
; InpUseDayLossCap is OFF: the soft 250 cap NEVER fired in 132 runs, so it
; only adds a way to stop a day early for no measured benefit.
;
; ================= BEFORE YOU START =================
;   * Fill InpTgToken / InpTgChatId on the machine. Never in the repo.
;   * Verify InpServerGmtOffset against the broker. The killzone window is
;     cut from a NY clock derived from it and is the only time gate here.
;   * Demo it first. Every number above is a backtest.
;
; ================= THE HONEST ODDS =================
; Passed 2 of the last 4 years. In the other 2 it drifted sideways without
; breaching. With no time limit that is a waiting game rather than a loss -
; but it is not a 4-in-4 strategy, and the two it passed are the two it was
; built on. Size your expectations to that, not to the 2026 column.
